Bambu Systematic Review
==========================

### Clone repository 
`git clone git@github.com:omixlab/Mabel.git`

### Open folder 
`cd Mabel`

### Docker
`make build`
`make run`

```
CELERY_BROKER_URL=XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=XXXXXXXXXXXXX
SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI=XXXXXXXXXXX
